# Routing constraints, checked before they ever reach the router.
#
#   routing-dsl check   constraints.route
#   routing-dsl compile constraints.route > constraints.json

# PG-Delta declines HDFC cards while every other issuer converts on it fine.
# Scoped to the broken path only, so the rest of its traffic stays put.
avoid PG-Delta when issuer HDFC ttl 8h canary 2% confidence 0.70

# A gateway-wide constraint: no issuer, so it applies to all traffic.
avoid PG-Bravo ttl 30m canary 5% confidence 0.85
